<title>GERMANY: German July import prices fall 0.3 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German July import prices fall 0.3 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    July 96     June 96    July 95</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  -0.3	  -0.7	 -0.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +0.5	  +0.2	 -0.3</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991)  97.1	  97.4	 96.6</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  -0.2	  -0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    -0.1	  +0.2	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 103.4	 103.6	103.5</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
